#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[cartesian decomposition]
Given a finite set $S : "FinSet"$, we define the type of _cartesian decompositions_ by
$
  "cart-dec" (S) :-= Sigma (A,B : "FinSet"), A xx_"FinSet" B  ~= S.
$
Where $xx_"FinSet"$ #local("00DZ")[cartesian product in FinSet].
